  {
    "id": "p7",
    "number": 7,
    "title": "P7. Prim으로 교과서 네트워크 풀기",
    "conditions_html": "<p>아래 네트워크에 Prim의 MST 알고리즘을 적용해 최소 비용 신장 트리가 만들어지는 과정을 보여 주세요. A번 정점에서 시작해요.</p><figure style=\"margin:16px 0\"><div class=\"figure-scroll\" style=\"max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto;background:white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 520\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"원문의 그래프\" style=\"background:white;width:800px;max-width:none;height:auto\"><title>원문의 그래프</title><g id=\"p7-problem-0-ch11-q02-network-e0\"><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#26394a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"235.0\" y=\"83.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#17212b\"> 7</text></g><g id=\"p7-problem-0-ch11-q02-network-e1\"><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#26394a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"120.0\" y=\"158.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#17212b\"> 5</text></g><g id=\"p7-problem-0-ch11-q02-network-e2\"><line x1=\"360\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#26394a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"245.0\" y=\"193.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#17212b\"> 9</text></g><g id=\"p7-problem-0-ch11-q02-network-e3\"><line x1=\"360\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"650\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#26394a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"505.0\" y=\"108.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#17212b\"> 8</text></g><g id=\"p7-problem-0-ch11-q02-network-e4\"><line x1=\"360\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"600\" y2=\"270\" stroke=\"#26394a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"480.0\" y=\"188.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#17212b\"> 7</text></g><g id=\"p7-problem-0-ch11-q02-network-e5\"><line x1=\"650\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"600\" y2=\"270\" stroke=\"#26394a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"625.0\" y=\"178.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#17212b\"> 5</text></g><g id=\"p7-problem-0-ch11-q02-network-e6\"><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"600\" y2=\"270\" stroke=\"#26394a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"365.0\" y=\"263.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#17212b\"> 15</text></g><g id=\"p7-problem-0-ch11-q02-network-e7\"><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"370\" stroke=\"#26394a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"245.0\" y=\"313.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#17212b\"> 6</text></g><g id=\"p7-problem-0-ch11-q02-network-e8\"><line x1=\"600\" y1=\"270\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"370\" stroke=\"#26394a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"480.0\" y=\"308.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#17212b\"> 8</text></g><g id=\"p7-problem-0-ch11-q02-network-e9\"><line x1=\"600\" y1=\"270\" x2=\"670\" y2=\"460\" stroke=\"#26394a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"635.0\" y=\"353.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#17212b\"> 9</text></g><g id=\"p7-problem-0-ch11-q02-network-e10\"><line x1=\"360\" y1=\"370\" x2=\"670\" y2=\"460\" stroke=\"#26394a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"515.0\" y=\"403.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#17212b\"> 11</text></g><g id=\"p7-problem-0-ch11-q02-network-A\"><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"60\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#26394a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"110\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#17212b\">A</text></g><g id=\"p7-problem-0-ch11-q02-network-B\"><circle cx=\"360\" cy=\"130\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#26394a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"360\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#17212b\">B</text></g><g id=\"p7-problem-0-ch11-q02-network-C\"><circle cx=\"650\" cy=\"110\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#26394a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"650\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#17212b\">C</text></g><g id=\"p7-problem-0-ch11-q02-network-D\"><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"280\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#26394a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"280\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#17212b\">D</text></g><g id=\"p7-problem-0-ch11-q02-network-E\"><circle cx=\"600\" cy=\"270\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#26394a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#17212b\">E</text></g><g id=\"p7-problem-0-ch11-q02-network-F\"><circle cx=\"360\" cy=\"370\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#26394a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"360\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#17212b\">F</text></g><g id=\"p7-problem-0-ch11-q02-network-G\"><circle cx=\"670\" cy=\"460\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#26394a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"670\" y=\"460\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#17212b\">G</text></g></svg></div><figcaption>원문의 그래프</figcaption></figure>",
